  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Sam and Pat are at the pond. Sam has a toy boat. It is small and white. A toy crocodile is on it. The boat goes on the water. \"Look!\" says Pat. \"The crocodile likes the water.\" Pat claps.",
      "Pat has a ball. He bounces it. \"Bounce, bounce!\" says Pat. Sam kicks the ball. It goes to the water. \"Oh no!\" says Sam. Pip comes. He is a good dog. Pip swims to the ball.",
      "Pip catches the ball. \"Good dog!\" says Sam. Pat throws the ball again. \"Can Pip catch it?\" asks Pat. Pip jumps and catches it. Then he looks at the boat. He sees the crocodile. \"Woof, woof!\" says Pip. \"It is a toy, Pip!\" says Sam."
    ],
    "summary": "Sam and Pat play at the pond with a toy boat and a ball. Pip catches the ball and barks at the toy crocodile.",
